Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=30}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That looks like it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:27.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[trumpet noises]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.53,0:02:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Momooo! Lunchtime! Momoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:34.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is he? Kinda weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Momoo\Nshow up late to a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:39.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:48.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] The possession of weapons\Nis a clear affront to my authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As an example to any other\Nwould-be rebels in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So they can see the fate\Nthat awaits them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] No way! That guy is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'd kill someone for\Njust having a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:08.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:11.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps] Hey, wait!\NDon't go out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:13.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] You have absolutely\Nno right to do this, Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Heh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've paid your tribute without\Nfail for over eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would we rebel against it {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:26.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just think about it. It makes no sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now take your hands off Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:32.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER F] It's not like\Nhe used the weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C] That's right! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER D] Yeah, let Genzo go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:40.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] Hoarding weapons shows\Nhe was planning a rebellion against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:44.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand...\NI could destroy you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, try to protect your\Nfriend so you won't give me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:53.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}an excuse to do that. Either way is fine,\Nbut rebellions will not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO grunts]\NEverybody just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:59.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you want to waste all of our\Nwork over the past eight years?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:02.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For what? The time for\Nyou to give your lives
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:05.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for this village was back\Nwhen they first came.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we must continue to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The most important thing is\Nthat we continue to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We swore we would not let them\Ndefeat us as long as we're alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:17.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well said! I agree with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:26.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Heh... it's good to know that even disgusting\Ninsects like you enjoy being alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:28.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:34.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There is no way any of you will ever come\Nclose to the perfection of the fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.49,0:04:37.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:37.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He wants you to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't just stand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:45.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Your deaths will mean nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:50.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must continue to be patient...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO grunts]\N... even if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:54.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] That's a good ending for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:57.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pay close attention, humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:00.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is what happens\Nto those who defy me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even if it is just\Ninside their tiny heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:04.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP] Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Up there! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's someone on the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN C] Who the hell is that guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am... the great warrior\Nof the sea, Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:27.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Also known as the Demon King Usopp,\Nfeared and hated by almost half the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:36.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I command thousands of men!\NLoyal and vicious men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the guy I told you about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:40.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The one with the long\Nnose that got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:44.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Bring on your thousands of men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll crush them one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:52.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] The Exploding Star did\Nnothing and now he's pissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Repulsive human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:58.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What can a creature like you do to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [USOPP gasps, shouts]\N– [ARLONG grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong, hold on just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After losing Gosa, we can't afford\Nto kill off any more tribute money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:16.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FISHMAN H] Villages are fun to destroy,\Nbut ruling over them makes us more money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] If we lose some,\Nwe can always get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fishmen must reign supreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:24.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's destroying it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:33.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]\NAm I... dead... yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not dead yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:35.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN F] Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Catch him and tear him apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:44.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FISHMAN K] Let's go back to Arlong Park\Nbefore he destroys everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN J] Yeah, I'm with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls]\NDon't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who does that chumsucker think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:55.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.\NYou can all live for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I'm so sorry, everybody.\NThis has all been my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:08.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NYou're not a fishman, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER F] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:10.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But who was that guy who attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:12.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's good to be back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:18.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] It's Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:19.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C] You!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You never just come walking\Nthrough Cocoyashi anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:34.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard quite a commotion. Arlong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I only have to get\Nseven million more berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your already bad reputation\Njust keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:55.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's fine. I am a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:58.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong can be a very reasonable\Nguy when he wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just need a little more money\Nto finish our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just seven million berries\Nshy of the 100 million goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, it's really not that\Nhigh a price considering...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:11.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... that it's gonna buy\Nback our village! Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:20.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] She tells me to run, but I got\Nnowhere else to go but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:23.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, I promised Luffy\NI'd bring her back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man... what's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:29.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause things are getting\Nmessy around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] I did. I put it\Non my plate. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Okay, sorry. How 'bout\Nyou eat this thing instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] I wouldn't feed that\Nrotten slop to my dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:48.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Shh. Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:55.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's something down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:58.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:05.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:09.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:13.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.66,0:09:17.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:21.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not cow... They don't swim. A hippo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:24.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, you can tell\Nit's from the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:27.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it doing all the way\Nout here in the East Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Why is he staring at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:37.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] He wants the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:38.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Quick, give it to\Nhim before he sinks the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:50.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bad sea cow! Stay away from our food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Yes! You knocked it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:57.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU yelps]\NOh, crap! You made it mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You back for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:00.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to punch\Nthis poor hungry hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:07.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's probably just a baby and\Ncan't catch food for herself yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Here you go. Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:15.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared. I won't hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:21.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI shouts]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:26.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:30.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?! Damn jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] It was gonna eat me\Nwith the plate. What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:39.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:40.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:42.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Stand back. This is my show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SANJI] Collier Coup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[momoo groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! And back to the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:01.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] You guys are insane. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:10.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]\NWhat's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Luffy... Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Five more minutes of this and\NI'll keel over from boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[HATCHAN grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:23.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Incredible! What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:27.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some kind of super-fish?!\NNot even the mighty Hatchan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:30.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,octopus leader of the Arlong\NPirates can pull you from the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:33.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an epic battle!\NI don't know who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you're the gutsiest\Nfish in the East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:41.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What the...?! It was me all along?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN grunts]\NYou are indeed the gutsiest fish
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the East Blue... Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on. That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:54.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Huh? Hey!\NWho're you?! Speak up, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who? Me? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Hatchan! But all my\Nfriends call me Hatchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] You a fishman too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! Of course!\NI'm an amazing octopus fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like\Nyou're just a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Uh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Marine... Or possibly a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:14.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:20.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Arlong isn't here, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] No. I thought you\Nmight know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HATCHAN] Apparently there's some long-nosed\Nguy running around causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.11,0:12:29.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So Arlong locked up the\Nlong nose's friend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:33.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}then went to Cocoyashi Village\Nto hunt down that pesky troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:35.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh man... Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] Well, I guess I'd better save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:42.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] This Cocoyashi Village.\NHow do I get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:45.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:51.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a guest. Hop in.\NI'll take you, swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw man, I can't shake these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:12.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN E] Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] All those in favor of\Nleaving Usopp alone say "aye."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Aye! Aye! Aye! Aye! Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool. You're dumber than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Ah, you agree\Nwith me too? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN grunt]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] He, he.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:34.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:38.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Egg Star... Special Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:41.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN E groans]\NRotten eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN K groans]\NI think I'm gonna ralph!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP giggles]\NI guess fishmen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,aren't all they're cracked up to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not one of those scaly morons\Ncan catch Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[giggling continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:10.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh? Hey... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps] Yeah, I'm fine!\NThanks for asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made it down safe and\Nsound as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:26.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong should be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.95,0:14:30.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Oh great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] No problem. Bye now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:36.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, one more thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot to\Nask you your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? We've been over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:46.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you my name.\NHatchan, nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.27,0:14:48.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What the hell happened here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:07.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:12.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me! Who did this, brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN L] Roronoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:17.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN L groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What...? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:23.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roronoa... Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] The pirate hunter...?\NHas he come to collect my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN L groans]\NWe had him. That man we caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was him. He was Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:38.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN L] Yes,\Nthe swordsman was Roronoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:50.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOO] Choo. Arlong... Found him, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:52.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhat is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP gasps] Don't tell me that Zoro's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:03.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Catching this scum isn't\Nenough to satisfy my hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Oh yeah? Well, then let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:11.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm sorry about earlier,\NI was just saying hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's how we do it in my village!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles nervously]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Long nose, you are one of Zoro's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:24.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for well-known\Nbounty hunters to come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps, giggles nervously]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:31.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything to\Ndo with Zoro. I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:33.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:36.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CHOO] Choo. Enough of your cowardly lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:40.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't know Zoro,\Nyou still stood against Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You die either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:45.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Okay! No more lies!\NZoro and I are like brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:48.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Partners for life! If you\Nso much as lay one of your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:51.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,creepy webbed fingers on me,\Nhe'll show up and kill you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Is that right? So, if I\Nkill you, Zoro will show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:16:59.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whines]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] No, no! That's not\Nwhat I was trying to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:03.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was trying to say the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Killing me is bad! If you keep\Nme alive, Zoro will show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:07.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:10.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] What I want to know is how...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] How did he escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:17.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] What I mean is,\Nsomeone {\i1}let{\i0} him escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:22.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think that somebody has betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was Nami who let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:27.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that bastard could take your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:28.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN E] Now that you mention it,\Nshe has been acting strange lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:31.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN F] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:34.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She even helped Zoro when\Nhe jumped into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN K] Don't tell me she\Nwas working with Zoro from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:38.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN O] And tricked us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:43.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] Don't forget.\NHer chief skill is deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:50.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed.\NThis is pure conjecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.14,0:17:55.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I swore I was a member\Nof this group eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:02.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My loyalty... is shown\Nwith this tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:08.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nami. It's natural\Nfor you to be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you should know, I don't suspect\Nyou of anything treacherous, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:15.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:19.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] After all, we've known\Neach other for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're just... a little\Non edge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:24.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all. Surely you\Ncan understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to focus on Zoro and\Nhis gang of bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:32.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Nami! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:39.97,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI grunts] He just had\Nto go and do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:42.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] What's wrong, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're pale... You feelin' okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As for long-nose here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:56.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] Not even you can save him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:18:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... Not when he defied Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:04.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How long?! How long will\NI be suspected of betrayal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] You're too\Nclever for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'll have the amount\NArlong and I agreed to soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense\Nfor me to betray you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] Eight years ago\Nyou agreed to purchase
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi Village for\N100 million berries. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:25.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I just can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You love nothing. Except money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You betrayed your family\Nand your village for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... Why do you care\Nfor this village now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.95,0:19:36.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This puny little heap of houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:42.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then I found this... in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It can't be... That's my...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! What do you mean?\NYou're saying he was captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:55.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:57.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They took him back to Arlong\NPark just a little while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:00.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That courageous young man stood\Nup to Arlong and those fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.83,0:20:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's probably dead by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.47,0:20:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[VILLAGER A gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad. They won't be forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:10.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He got caught right\Nafter my little visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:14.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Usopp! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:36.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yeah! Ha-ha!\NFaster to Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N... Nami! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:53.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Caitlin Glass singing "Run! Run! Run!"]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=31}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=28}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
